> This is independent of the type of argument they expect.
>

Well, "group" is used mostly for species of animal gismu. Any ideas what
would be the best name for it for newbies?


>
> What do you think of something like "mi ckire lo cevni lo nu mi ka'e
>>> viska"?
>>>
>>
> You skipped this one. Can't x3 of ckire be an event?
>

1. I don't think so. This implies x3 is independent of x2
2. Actually I don't separate events and properties. They can often be in
the same places, I agree that this rule needs further clarification.


>
>
>>  means you want it to be only for abstract cones? Would a traffic cone
